{
  "description": "Audience exclusion beats selection (strict audience filtering, R1 to R4). A section marked {agent=skip}, with its subsections and every block in it, is withheld from every agent view whatever the request names: the section itself, a subsection under it, or both with a visible one. The agent block, danger, requirement and constraint in it stay hidden too, and an include in it is not fetched. The exclusion is recorded as a skipped-section omission even when the section was named, no command is offered to recover it (the same section read would exclude it again), and naming it alone creates no unsatisfied dependency, so the read stays complete.",
